e pocket of her suit, and points it at the Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The three shift focus to the convoy, weapons raised. The cars stop on the opposite end of the bridge."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Team_Running","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bodyguards in black step out and flank a middle-aged man in a suit carrying a cane as he walks toward the Commander and company."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Doss_AB","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What a show. Seems I arrived just in time."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The man wears sunglasses even though it's dark. He carries no weapon and strolls casually, in spite of the guns aimed at him."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But the bodyguards around him and the glint of a sigil on his ring finger leave no doubt about his identity—"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Doss..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Doss_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Doss","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I came to see how things turned out."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Doss_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's done."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Doss_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Doss","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good. And these leftover pests—do I have to teach you how to deal with them too?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-M16_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Beluga","narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_pistol_finalshot_n","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Select","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Beluga fires, blowing out the front-right tire on the Commander's car. Doss' bodyguards fan out, guns drawn."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Prepare for battle!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
